    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS are delighted to welcome you to 4 Lake Lawn which is a superb three-bedroom semi-detached family home offering generous living accommodation and exceptional outdoor space nestled in a mature and highly sought-after residential setting.\r\n\r\nThis attractive property benefits from ample off-street parking to the front and boasts a versatile attic conversion, ideal for additional storage space. The accommodation is well-proportioned throughout and offers excellent potential for modern family living.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, the property enjoys a substantial west-facing garden, providing an ideal setting for outdoor entertaining, gardening enthusiasts, or families seeking a safe and spacious outdoor environment. The sunny aspect ensures afternoon and evening sunshine throughout much of the year.\r\n\r\nFurther enhancing the appeal of this home is an attached garage, offering valuable storage space and potential for future conversion, subject to the necessary planning permissions.\r\n\r\nLocated within easy reach of both  Douglas Village & Ballinlough ,excellent schools, shops, restaurants and a host of local amenities, 4 Lake Lawn  presents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a family home in one of Cork's most desirable residential locations."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - \r\nSpacious entrance hall with new laminate flooring and under stairs storage. There is a striking circular port hole window which is an eye catching architectural feature.\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 4.2m x 3.6m \r\nNew Laminate flooring and feature tiled fireplace, large window overlooking the front of the property.\r\n\r\nDining room - 3.8m x 3.0m \r\nNew laminate flooring and window overlooking west facing garden.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 7.0m x 2.7m \r\nWhich also overlooks  the rear garden has a modern fitted kitchen with fridge freezer, hob , oven as well as integrated dishwasher. There is a stainless steel sink & drainer and gas fire.\r\n\r\nUPSTAIRS - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.7m x 3.5m \r\nSpacious double bedroom located to the front of the house. It has a large window, built-in wardrobes, and carpet flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.0m x 2.8m \r\nDouble bedroom located to the rear of the home with carpet flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.8m x 2.5m \r\nSingle bedroom located to the front of the house, carpet flooring, built in wardrobe and window overlooking the front of the property. \r\n\r\nBathroom - \r\nTiled bathroom comprising a three-piece suite with electric shower. \r\n\r\nAttic Room - 4.3m x 2.7m \r\nThis has new laminate flooring and one velux window and is used for storage.\r\n\r\nAttic WC - \r\nWc & whb\r\n\r\nGarage - 5.4m x 3.0m \r\nThere is access at the front and rear.\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE - \r\nGravel driveway to the front with lawned garden and beautiful flowers and shrubbery . West facing lawned garden to the rear ideal for summer barbeques\n\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Most sought after location.\r\nClose to all services such as churches, shops and sports ameneties.\r\nGreat schools and sports amenities nearby.\r\nNatural gas central heating.\r\nLarge west facing rear garden\r\nAmple off street parking\r\nAttached garage with conversion potential (subject to planning)"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: F"
      }
